\paragraph{Improved UCF101 protocol.} On the corrected protocol (Table~\ref{tab:ucf_scuba_small}), \approachname{} reaches 26.23\% contrasted accuracy against 17.53\% for the baseline and 24.40\% for StillMix, and Avg SCUFO of 0.14\% versus 0.36\% for StillMix. Combined with StillMix augmentation, contrasted accuracy rises to 31.14\%. IID accuracy is 94.98\% (baseline 95.51\%, StillMix 96.14\%). Absolute SCUBA numbers are low on this protocol, consistent with the removal of leaked background cues.

